			"Message": "refactor(Worker): remove obsolete shim cache from service worker logic\n\n- Removes `CACHE_SHIM` constant and related cache entries from `Source/Worker.ts`, simplifying the caching strategy\n- Updates README.md documentation to reflect removal of shim cache section\n- Deletes `Target/Worker.d.ts` and updates `Target/Worker.js` as rebuilt artifacts from source changes\n\nThis cleanup aligns with Land's performance focus by reducing unnecessary caching logic in the service worker. The shim cache was part of an earlier polyfill strategy that's no longer needed as the project matures its asset handling approach. Generated files in Target/ demonstrate the build system's function (MVP Deliverable #7) but should ultimately be excluded via .gitignore as per established patterns.\n\nRefs d43b06c",
