			"Message": "chore(build): exclude generated worker scripts from version control\n\n- Added `Target/Worker.d.ts` to excluded files list to avoid tracking generated TypeScript definitions\n- Updated `Target/Worker.js` exclusion to reflect modified build output artifacts\n\nThese changes align with Land's strategy to keep version control focused on source assets rather than build products. As part of the Worker component implementation for background processing in Sky/Cocoon, generated worker scripts should be managed through the build system (likely Rest bundler) rather than versioned directly. This reduces repository noise and prevents accidental conflicts in build artifacts as the worker architecture evolves.",
			"SHA": "d43b06c6194fe1f18d8d7982ef98c3a9a2e9f724"
		},
