				"⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀",
				42,
				12
			],
			"Message": "chore(Build/ESBuild): Minify configuration files and remove source maps\n\n- Minified `Target.js` and `Worker.js` ESBuild configuration files by removing comments and shortening variable names\n- Deleted associated `.js.map` source map files which are unnecessary for production builds\n- Excluded generated `Target/Worker` files from version control as build artifacts\n\nThese changes optimize the build configuration for the `Rest` bundler component, which handles JS bundling for the `Cocoon` extension host. By reducing configuration file size and removing debug artifacts:\n1. Improves build tool performance during CI/CD pipelines\n2. Reduces final disk footprint of the bundled extension host\n3. Aligns with Land's core goal of minimizing resource usage compared to Electron\n4. Maintains production readiness while preserving development-mode source maps via environment flags",
			"SHA": "45dd6ddad1c5f9026fd9b8e9037eaa8f696d6a07"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
