			],
			"Message": "chore(build): improve ESBuild configuration with source maps and cleanup\n\n- Refactored ESBuild configuration files (Target.js, Worker.js) for improved readability and maintainability\n- Added source map generation for both configurations to enhance debugging capabilities in development mode\n- Implemented proper environment variable handling for __DEV__ and __INCREMENT__ flags aligning with Land's build process\n- Enhanced Worker.js configuration with explicit type annotations and cleanup logic for output directories\n- Excluded generated Target/Worker files from tracking to reduce repository noise\n\nThese changes support the Rest component's bundling process for Cocoon extension host shim by providing clearer build artifacts and better development tooling. Source maps are crucial for debugging the extension host environment which directly impacts extension compatibility efforts.",
